/// Synopsis: the theme's cover: list markers, `-> item`, `===` pill, `> ` box, `"quote"` and `#quote` (without `block: true`) veiled after `#pause`; no phantom subtitle pill on the 2nd subpage; a covered block that breaks across pages is hidden; `~underline~`, `~~alert~~` and a non-breaking space in covered running text (a whole paragraph and from the middle of one) keep their look and the length of the line; a covered chip, highlight and icon are veiled whole (sides and edges included), on the page, in a callout (the veil in the color of the callout, not white bands) and in an exercise; an `emph-box` with a title or an icon (badge and border included), a `#tag` (its outset included), a `#eq-box` in a line and `#info("logo")` in covered running text are veiled whole; one covered line after a `#pause` alone on its line (an arrow line, a list item) is veiled whole.
#import "../../common.typ": *
#show: setup
#include "body.typ"
